Content-app lookups behind a file HEAD request (the ``index.html`` probe, the directory listing and the exact file lookup) now check repository membership per matching row instead of walking the whole repository version's content set. The ``index.html`` probe is skipped for file paths, directory listings are capped by ``DIRECTORY_LISTING_LIMIT``, and ``RepositoryVersion.get_content()`` can run an interval-table variant as an A/B experiment.
